SUMMARY:2026 Artist-In-Residence Joe Lovano and Dave Douglas Quintet: Sound Prints
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - Carhartt Amphitheater Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. Sound Prints is the long-running collaborative quintet co-led by saxophonist Joe Lovano and trumpeter Dave Douglas\, originally formed to play music inspired by Wayne Shorter's compositions and books.
